cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pdefa in research, please cite it."
title: "pdefa: CPU inference engine with built-in image loader + YOLO post-process"
abstract: >
  A zero-dependency CPU inference engine written in C++20 with AVX2 SIMD
  kernels, exposed to Python via ctypes. Built-in PNG/JPEG loader, ONNX to
  engine converter, and YOLO post-processing.
version: 1.0.3
date-released: 2026-09-24
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
